 "sources": [
  {
   "id": "teacher-2026-11-08-cas-06",
   "recordedOn": "2026-11-08",
   "description": {
    "sr": "Profesorov spisak šestog časa (06.11.2026), zapisan 08.11.2026. redom vođenja spiska; broj uz zapis je broj fotografija tog rada. Čas je nastavak rada na prototipovima i početak tekstilnog zadatka (A3 predlozi i tekstilni prototipi). Fotografije su na telefonu profesora (Galaxy S23 FE, /Internal storage/DCIM/Camera); niz počinje snimkom 20261106_120954.jpg (tekstilni A3 poster) i završava se fotografijom drvenog lavirinta sa crnim i belim perlama; posle nje ide 23 fotografije iz udruženja.",
    "en": "The professor’s list of the sixth class (6 November 2026), recorded on 8 November 2026 in the order the list was kept; the number beside an entry is that work’s photograph count. The class continues the prototype work and opens the textile task (A3 proposals and textile prototypes). The photographs are on the professor’s phone (Galaxy S23 FE, /Internal storage/DCIM/Camera); the sequence starts with frame 20261106_120954.jpg (a textile A3 poster) and ends with a photograph of a wooden labyrinth with black and white pearls; 23 photographs from the association follow it."
   }
  }
 ],
